  "mn114:8.8": "The discussions at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn8/en/sujato#13.1'>MN 8:13.1</a> and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an7.53/en/sujato'>AN 7.53</a> show that this refers to the initial thought that precedes action. ",
